  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNECA, JFA Business Plan</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNECA, JFA Business Plan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till UNECAs Business Plan 2007-2009 genom ett gemensamt finaniseringsavtal med UK och DK om 40 MSEK (total JFA 80 MSEK) till omr&#xE5;dena 1) Gender 2) Governance, 3) Handel och regional integration, samt 4) Makroekonomisk policy konvergens. Avtalet kan komma att ut&#xF6;kas till flera givare och flera omr&#xE5;den, exempelvis klimatf&#xF6;r&#xE4;ndringar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to UNECA&apos;s Business Plan 2007-2009 through a Joint Financing Arrangement with UK and Dk for 40 MSEK (total JFA 80 MSEK) in the areas of 1) Gender, 2) Governance, 3) Trade and regional integration, and 4) Macroeconomic policy convergance. The agreement can be expanded to include more donors and more thematic areas, e.g. climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
